Package: libnumerics-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: C++20 library for scientific computing
 numerics is a C++20 library for scientific computing: dense and sparse linear
 algebra, iterative solvers, eigenvalues, ODE and PDE integrators, FFTs,
 quadrature, root finding and stochastic methods.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the static library and the CMake package.
